Description: Real-time algorithmic trading application
 L2Trader is a sophisticated trading platform built with Qt6 that connects
 to TradeStation and Financial Modeling Prep (FMP) APIs to provide real-time
 market data analysis, Level 2 market depth visualization, automated stock
 screening, and breaking news monitoring.
 .
 Key Features:
  * Real-Time Market Data with Level 2 quotes
  * Automated Stock Screening
  * Breaking News Monitoring
  * Interactive Price Charts
  * Position Tracking
  * Algorithmic Trading capabilities

Package: l2trader-tests
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         l2trader (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Unit tests for L2Trader
 This package contains unit tests for the L2Trader application:
  * BarCache unit tests
  * FMPClient unit tests
  * RunUpDetector unit tests
  * TSClient unit tests
